#43496
Salvation~
The chamber opens into a large, well-lit and, aside from the vortex on the
opposite side, empty room.  There is a sublime feeling of serenity emmenating
from the room, compelling you to stay within its grasp.  The walls, a perfectly
worked white marble seemingly untouched by the ravages of time, stretch
steadfastly upwards, holding up the large dome top of the tower.  Why such a
holy place exists in the heart of an evil and dreary place no man can be sure,
but the vileness of the monsters seems to be repelled by the sanctity of the
room, preventing them from desecrating this hallowed ground.    
~
